# Store every text file with LF in the repository, whatever the working copy
# uses. Without this, committing from Windows stores CRLF, and the first person
# to touch the project from macOS or Linux produces a diff that claims every
# line of every file changed. Checkout still gets native endings on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the lockfile out of diffs and merges; it is generated, and a conflict in
# it is resolved by re-running the install, never by hand-editing.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated

# The design document is the real reading material here, but it is 900+ lines
# of Korean prose, so without this GitHub reports the project as mostly
# Markdown rather than TypeScript.
DESIGN.md linguist-documentation
